<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tosco Corp started as buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tosco Corp started as buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Furman Selz initiated coverage of Tosco Corp as a buy.</p>
<p>-- set a 12-18 month price target of $120 a share.</p>
<p>-- set 1997 earnings estimates of $5.33 per diluted share and 1998 earnings estimate of $6.80 per diluted share.</p>
<p>-- said believes growth in earnings and cash flow will boost the value of Tosco over the next two years.</p>
<p>-- Tosco gained 1/8 to 90 a share in morning trading.</p>
<p>(( -- Wall Street desk 212-859-1730))</p>
</text>
